{
  "mn19:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 19 ",
  "mn19:0.2": "Dvedhāvitakkasutta ",
  "mn19:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn19:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn19:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn19:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn19:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn19:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn19:2.1": "“Pubbeva me, bhikkhave, sambodhā anabhisambuddhassa bodhisattasseva sato etadahosi: ",
  "mn19:2.2": "‘yannūnāhaṁ dvidhā katvā dvidhā katvā vitakke vihareyyan’ti. ",
  "mn19:2.3": "So kho ahaṁ, bhikkhave, yo cāyaṁ kāmavitakko yo ca byāpādavitakko yo ca vihiṁsāvitakko—",
  "mn19:2.4": "imaṁ ekaṁ bhāgamakāsiṁ; ",
  "mn19:2.5": "yo cāyaṁ nekkhammavitakko yo ca abyāpādavitakko yo ca avihiṁsāvitakko—",
  "mn19:2.6": "imaṁ dutiyaṁ bhāgamakāsiṁ. ",
  "mn19:3.1": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhikkhave, evaṁ appamattassa ātāpino pahitattassa viharato uppajjati kāmavitakko. ",
  "mn19:3.2": "So evaṁ pajānāmi: ",
  "mn19:3.3": "‘uppanno kho me ayaṁ kāmavitakko. ",
  "mn19:3.4": "So ca kho attabyābādhāyapi saṁvattati, parabyābādhāyapi saṁvattati, ubhayabyābādhāyapi saṁvattati, paññānirodhiko vighātapakkhiko anibbānasaṁvattaniko’. ",
  "mn19:3.5": "‘Attabyābādhāya saṁvattatī’tipi me, bhikkhave, paṭisañcikkhato abbhatthaṁ gacchati; ",
  "mn19:3.6": "‘parabyābādhāya saṁvattatī’tipi me, bh